OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of tents left by
OL,4,Afestivalgoers despite pleas
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany Reading Festival attendees ignored
OL,7,Fpleas to take their tents home with
OL,8,Fhundreds clearly visible across the
OL,9,Fsite on Tuesday.
OL,11,FFestival Republic says on its website
OL,12,Fthat its aim for the event was that no
OL,13,Ftents were left behind following the
OL,14,Fannual extravaganza, which was attended
OL,15,Fby about 100,000 people.
OL,17,FIt said that fewer tents are being
OL,18,Fdiscarded than in previous decades,
OL,19,Fwith two-thirds of them taken home from
OL,20,Fthe Richfield Avenue site after 2025's
OL,21,Ffestival.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
