OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of tents left by
OL,4,Afestivalgoers despite pleas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has committed that all of
OL,7,Fthe site will be returned to its
OL,8,Fnatural state within a fortnight of the
OL,9,Ffestival closing on 30 August.
